<item>
<title>[TPP-9415] CPMS 2052A Create File</title>
<link>https://jira.us.bank-dns.com/browse/TPP-9415</link>
<project id="15308" key="TPP">CT-TPP Operations, Pricing, Bonds &amp; Cash</project>
<description><p><b>As a developer</b><br/> <b>I want</b> to create the required output file<br/> <b>So that</b> downstream systems receive accurate and complete data.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li><h3><a name="Background"></a><b>Background</b></h3></li> </ul> <ul> <li> <ul> <li><b>FR2052a</b> is a Fed-mandated regulatory report requiring reporting of <b>full balances of active Lines of Credit (LOCs)</b>.</li> <li>Current Financial Data Warehouse (FDW) views lack this granularity; CPMS identified as the direct source for LOC data.</li> <li>Request originates from <b>audit findings</b>; classified as <b>high critical priority</b> due to regulatory nature and bank’s progression toward <b>Category II classification</b>. <hr /> <h3><a name="CurrentState"></a><b>Current State</b></h3></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li> <ul> <li> CPMS sends data to FDW in these view:  (WHAT IS OUR CPMS VIEW?????) <ul> <li>THIS IS FDV VIEW </li> <li><tt>FDW VIEW 1:  dwadmin.collateral_charge_data</tt></li> <li><tt>FDW View 2:  dwadmin.dly_collateral_balance_data</tt></li> </ul> </li> <li>Manual process exists for generating required report from CPMS; specific file with total balances is manually saved by Johannes’s team.</li> <li>File location:  \\us.bank-dns.com\NAS\pri\treasury-app_prod\Reports\CPMS\CPMSRpts\MMDDYYYY</li> <li>FDW migration to AWS is <b>lift-and-shift</b> (connection string updates only, no data changes). <h3><a name="%C2%A0"></a> </h3></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <h3><a name="Timeline%28anysuggestionsonthis%29"></a><b>Timeline (any suggestions on this)</b></h3> <ul> <li> <ul> <li><b>Requested Delivery</b>: Feb 2026 month-end before March CPMA deadline</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><a name="Risks"></a><b>Risks</b></h3> <ul> <li> <ul> <li>Production data required for parallel testing (UAT not sufficient). <hr /> <h3><a name="Clarifications"></a><b>Clarifications</b></h3></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li> <ul> <li>Possibly only one file needed for downstream delivery (to confirm).</li> <li>Workflow and file transmission details from CPMS to FMR/MRO pending from Diana and Glenn. <hr /> <h3><a name="Ownership"></a><b>Ownership</b></h3></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li> <ul> <li>Johannes’s team manages balances and maturity dates for each LOC.</li> <li>Reconciliation done against FHLB records.</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <p> </p></description>
