<comment id="10699618" author="tmkaras" created="Wed, 14 Jan 2026 20:43:46 -0600"><p>Completed first version of new SSIS package CPMSExportLOCCollateralData.dtsx and generated first version of LOC_Collateral.txt file.  </p> <p>Sent the following email to Diana and Kurt.  </p> <p><em>Diana,</em></p> <p><em>Attached is the LOC collateral file I created via new SSIS package running locally on my PC against Development database.  There is no good data in dev right now to create the file.  I manually populated data from Prod for 1/8 to generate this file.  I still have some work to do on SSIS package but wanted to have you check the file format and maybe send it to MRO if it looks good.</em> </p> <p> </p> <p><em>Kurt, the file is located on \\us.bank-dns.com\NAS\pri\treasury-app_dev\FileTransfer\ConnectDirect\CPMS\Send\ if you need it for Autosys.</em> </p> <p><em>I also placed in progress copy of CPMSExportLOCCollateralData.dtsx on \\VMBKSA69901MHH\ssis\corptreasury\CPMS_CAR2165.</em> </p></comment>
